---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm - - - - " MSE "

---SCREEN                                                          
=LINLIB generic keyboard command/actions
                                                                                
+."common"..........             ."on active line"...          --sample-view--      
+get help:          .:HE...      menu item select:    .:SP...  .MSE. .mse.....       
+exit/close page:   .:EX...                  select:  .:NL...                        
+refresh page:      .:RE...      alter or toggle,              .ALT. .alt2.          
+cancel:            .:CA...                 forward:  .:SP...                        
+next line:         .:TA...                backward:  .:DE...                        
+                                switch to edit,               .VAR. .var.....       
+."page navigation".                   keep content:  .:SP...                        
+jump to 1st line:  .:KH...                   clear:  .:DE...                        
+     - last line:  .:KE...                                                         
+next page/part:    .:PU...     ."in edit mode".........           --option----        
+prev page/part:    .:PD...     toggle Ins/Ovr mode:     .:KI...   .:PR .:PR...        
+                               erase left from cursor:  .:DE...                       
+."special".........                erase below cursor:  .:KD...   .:PR .:DE...        
+commit,                                 erase up to end.......... .:PR .:SP...        
+  complete editing,            jump to 1st symbol:      .:KH...   .:PR .:AL...        
+    next line:     .:NL...       jump to end of text:   .:KE...   .:PR .:AR...        
+option prefix:     .:PR...                                                         
+                                                                                      
=LINLIB (c) 1986-1990,2020 vsv & team
---END                          

     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
     
                                                                               

























































































